  directions and a Google reviews link
- Floating WhatsApp button on every page with a prefilled message
- FAQ section and "Meet the specialists" section with qualification and
  registration number fields
- npm run check:launch lists placeholders and unreviewed content in
  src/content/site.ts
- Header, footer and WhatsApp button moved into the root layout so they
  appear on every page; nav links now work from inner pages
- Content model: structured address and opening hours, Google links,
  team, services, FAQ and checklist all in src/content/site.ts

